      "content": "idk im just so exhausted tho... like i literally havent slept in like 20 hours and the jet lag is hitting crazy hard. i dont really want to sit in an er waiting room for 6 hours if it's just my muscles aching from sitting so long. isn't it pretty common to feel this way after such a long trip?? can't i just take some ibuprofen and drink a bunch of water and see if it gets better by morning?",
