      "role": "user",
      "content": "ugh i get it but im literally broke right now and the thought of a hospital bill for something that is probably just a cramp is stressing me out more than the actual pain lol. if i just stay lying down and keep my leg elevated and take a high dose of aspirin, would that help clear up any inflammation or something? i really just want to avoid the doctor unless it gets way worse.",
